        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: താപനില",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താപനില — tāpanila — \"temperature\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇന്ന് താപനില മുപ്പതിന് മുകളിൽ ആണ്. innŭ tāpanila muppatinŭ mukaḷil āṇŭ. Today's temperature is above thirty."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താപം, heat, plus നില, a level: the level of heat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താപനില (tāpanila) is a Malayalam compound built from താപം, heat, from Sanskrit tāpa (Monier-Williams), and the native നില, a standing or level (DEDR 3675)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
