              "text": "തീരദേശത്ത് ആർദ്രത കൂടുതലാണ്. tīradēśattŭ ārdrata kūṭutalāṇŭ. Humidity is higher in the coastal region."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word from the weather report; people say the air is heavy and you sweat."
            }
          ]
        },
